The {{Term/Store|Salvager Armor Set||Series, BotW}} is an [[Armor Set]] in {{BotW}}.<ref name="BotW Piggyback 451"/>

==Location and Uses==
The Salvager Armor Set is an [[Armor Set]] consisting of the [[Salvager Headwear]], [[Salvager Vest]], and [[Salvager Trousers]], added as part of the "[[Xenoblade Chronicles 2|[Xenoblade Chronicles 2]]]" collaboration in {{BotW}}'s [[The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild#Updates|Version 1.3.3 update]]. All three pieces are found throughout [[Hyrule]] where red [[Shooting Star]]s fall, as part of the "[Xenoblade Chronicles 2]" [[Side Quest]]. Each piece provides a level of [[Swim Speed Up]] when equipped, with the adoption of the entire Armor Set granting [[Swim Dash Stamina Up]]. The Salvager Armor Set cannot be upgraded by a [[Great Fairy]] nor [[Hateno Dye|Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. Once found, [[Granté]] sells parts of the Armor Set for 50 [[Rupee]]s apiece.

